X:1
T:See Amid the Winter's Snow
T:HUMILITY
C:Music: John Goss, 1870 · Words: Edward Caswall, 1851
S:Open Hymnal Project ABC (openhymnal.org; marked public domain), melody line with every stanza as printed there; their source: "The Children's Hymnal, with Tunes", 1875 Hymn 233. Ed. John Ireland Tucker, but marked as being an older arrangement.. Melody cross-checked against the hymnary.org score (hymnary.org/tune/humility_goss): 97% of pitches and 100% of note lengths agree.
